      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'After manually attached to a Satelite, EchoSensors possess the capabilities
    of both EchoLocators and Sensors.

    Sensors, verify the area around said Satelite
    for motion(excellent in sudden meteor showers), and report through audio, without
    the need to use your camera(great for when you are occupied repairing). Altough,
    the Sensor reports with a time delay.

'
